Meta.documentation:List.get
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Picks one element out of a flowing list by position.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:The first Number in the flow is the index (0-based); every
Meta.documentation:other element is a candidate.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:A list can mix any types, so results cannot be bound at compile time:
Meta.documentation:like http:, the operator declares no typed outputs — it late-connects,
Meta.documentation:wrapping each result in its own typed resource at execution time and
Meta.documentation:connecting that to the downstream connectee (see docs/output-interfaces.md).
Meta.documentation:The index may also be a parameter: ?|index=2
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_index — the position to pick (parameter drop-in)
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_$all — String element candidate
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_$all — Number element candidate
Meta.documentation:@port in_Blob_$all — Blob element candidate
Meta.documentation:@port in_Boolean_$all — Boolean element candidate
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:[String:a String:b String:c Number:1]>>List.get:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:b
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:[Number:10 Number:20 Number:30]>>List.get:?|index=2>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:30
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see List.length List.join
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0Aconst%20castLib%20%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Scheme%2Fcast%22)%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20Picks%20one%20element%20out%20of%20a%20flowing%20list%20by%20position%20(0-based).%0A%2F%2F%20The%20first%20Number%20in%20the%20flow%20is%20the%20index%3B%20every%20other%20element%20is%20a%0A%2F%2F%20candidate.%20A%20list%20can%20mix%20any%20types%2C%20so%20the%20picked%20element's%20type%20is%20known%0A%2F%2F%20only%20at%20execution%20time%20%E2%80%94%20get%20declares%20no%20typed%20outputs.%20Like%20http%3A%2C%20it%0A%2F%2F%20late-connects%3A%20the%20picked%20element%20is%20wrapped%20in%20its%20own%20typed%20resource%2C%0A%2F%2F%20connected%20to%20the%20downstream%20connectee%2C%20and%20fired.%0Afunction%20get()%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22get%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%3DgetProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20getProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2Cresource)%3B%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%09this.in_begin%20%3D%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09this.index%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09%09this.elements%20%3D%20%5B%5D%3B%0A%09%09return%20this.fire_end_parameters()%3B%20%2F%2F%20pre-positioned%20parameter%20inputs%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%20%20%20%20function%20addElement(type)%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%09%09return%20function(input)%20%7B%20this.elements.push(%7Btype%3Atype%2C%20value%3Ainput.value%7D)%3B%20%7D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%09this.in_Number_index%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%09%09this.index%20%3D%20Math.floor(input.value.valueOf())%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%09this.in_String_%24all%20%3D%20addElement(%22String%22)%3B%0A%09this.in_Number_%24all%20%3D%20addElement(%22Number%22)%3B%0A%09this.in_Boolean_%24all%20%3D%20addElement(%22Boolean%22)%3B%0A%09this.in_Blob_%24all%20%3D%20addElement(%22Blob%22)%3B%0A%09this.in_end%20%3D%20function()%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%09%09if%20(this.index%20%3D%3D%3D%20null)%20return%3B%0A%09%09let%20element%20%3D%20this.elements%5Bthis.index%5D%3B%0A%09%09if%20(!element%20%7C%7C%20!this.connectee)%20return%3B%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20late%20connect%20(like%20http%3A)%20%E2%80%94%20the%20type%20is%20known%20only%20now%0A%09%09let%20cast%20%3D%20castLib.castValue(element.type%2C%20element.value)%3B%0A%09%09if%20(cast)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09cast.connect(this.connectee)%3B%0A%09%09%09cast.in_go%3F.()%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%7D%0Aget.Processor%3DgetProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%3Dget%3B]>>NewResource:List.get
